  "tagline": "Compact, rugged profiler with automatic oven setup",
  "intro": [
    {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "The KIC Profiler X⁵ is a compact, rugged intelligent thermal profiler built for tough daily handling. Its circuitry tolerates the voltage spikes found in some ovens and wave solder machines, it runs on batteries or USB power, and its software picks the best oven setup for each new board."
    }
