      "blocks": [
        {
          "t": "list",
          "items": [
            "7, 9 and 12 channel versions with standard Type K thermocouple connectors",
            "Datalogger model downloads by USB; RF dual-unit model sends data to the PC in real time",
            "Measures slope, peak temperature and time above liquidus, and calculates the Process Window Index (PWI)",
            "Navigator Power finds the best oven setup: centre of the process window, maximum conveyor speed or minimum electricity use",
            "Prediction of profile changes from setpoint changes, and SPC charts for trends",
            "3 AAA batteries (rechargeable optional); powered by USB when connected",
